        "summary": {
          "en-US": "Drive your Patchbay computers' chats and coding agents from your phone"
        },
        "description": {
          "en-US": "Patchbay Remote joins your Patchbay mesh as a phone. It shows the chats and Code\nsessions of your computers, live, and lets you send messages, answer an agent's\npermission requests and stop a turn.\n\nThe phone does no work of its own and keeps no copy of your data or API keys. It\nconnects to whichever of your computers it can reach: on your home network, or\nthrough ZeroTier, Tailscale or a VPN. No cloud service sits in between.\n\nYou need Patchbay on at least one computer, and the mesh passphrase. A computer\napproves the phone before it can connect."
        },
